        {
            "docs": [
                "unstake() — new_user_stake == 0 implique la purge de TOUTES les",
                "souscriptions de l'utilisateur sur ce staked_token (un event",
                "unsubscribe UNSUBSCRIBE_FULL_UNSTAKE est aussi émis par stream)."
            ],
            "identifier": "unstake",
            "inputs": [
                {
                    "name": "caller",
                    "type": "Address",
                    "indexed": true
                },
                {
                    "name": "staked_token",
                    "type": "TokenIdentifier",
                    "indexed": true
                },
                {
                    "name": "amount",
                    "type": "BigUint",
                    "indexed": true
                },
                {
                    "name": "new_user_stake",
                    "type": "BigUint",
                    "indexed": true
                },
                {
                    "name": "new_total_staked",
                    "type": "BigUint",
                    "indexed": true
                },
                {
                    "name": "timestamp_ms",
                    "type": "u64",
                    "indexed": true
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "docs": [
                "Un reward réellement payé sur UN stream — émis depuis",
                "settle_one_reward_stream, donc quel que soit le déclencheur",
                "(claimRewards, claimAllRewards, stake, unstake, unsubscribeReward).",
                "Jamais émis pour un montant nul."
            ],
